        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "CUSTOM",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Heal my team - posted rate",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/heal_paid"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add met_deepcore_nurse"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "healed"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "heal_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Use the PC",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:pc/open"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "pc_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Anyone need a hand around here?",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add met_deepcore_nurse"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    Cmd: "tellraw @initiator [{\"text\":\"Foreman Kang, if you can stand his grumbling. Old union man, retired to a stool by the pit-head. Says the new ore ledger reads like a lie he cannot spell.\",\"color\":\"gold\"}]"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Conditions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                                    Operation: "EQUALS",
                                    Name: "no_deepcore_restructure_done"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "kang_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "What is the dojo shouting about?",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add met_deepcore_nurse"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    Cmd: "tellraw @initiator [{\"text\":\"Old Dun runs the Iron Ladder down a played-out shaft. Three fights, no heals between them. Bring me the pieces after and I will not ask how it went.\",\"color\":\"gold\"}]"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Conditions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                                    Operation: "EQUALS",
                                    Name: "no_iron_ladder_cleared"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "ladder_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Any news off the road?",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add met_deepcore_nurse"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    Cmd: "tellraw @initiator [{\"text\":\"A water delegation came up from Gaviota Port asking after this mine - after the reserve numbers, specifically. Leader Neptune does not send people to ask about weather. Somebody down the coast is worried too.\",\"color\":\"aqua\"}]"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "gaviota_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Just passing",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add met_deepcore_nurse"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Orrin. I sold lamp oil at the commissary for twenty years and then this town needed somebody at the Center desk more than it needed wick. Same counter manner, better stock. The rate is posted on the wall and I can look you in the eye about it. Sit your team down - the supply road runs easier since somebody gave the fields back."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Careful, careful - set them down like crates of oil, not sacks of gravel. A peddler learns hands before a medic does, that is my theory and my patients have stopped arguing with it. I keep the posted rate, same for a miner as for a champion. My deliveries even arrive on time now the road past the fields runs quiet. Whatever you did out there, it reaches this counter."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Half this waiting room is dojo bruises and the other half read their pay slip too closely. I used to sell those men rope. Now I splint them. The Center rate is chalked where the oil prices used to be, and unlike some boards in this town every number on mine is true. The road up from the fields runs cleaner than it did a badge ago - my crates noticed even if the ledgers pretend not to."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Orrin Stonelace - Center desk",
                    Label: "default"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Thank you, Orrin",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "There - mended and billed at the posted rate, same as everyone who crosses my floor. Quarry Road brought you in rough. Rest while the pit lets you."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Good as new. Gaviota is a long haul down the coast road and the water gets deeper the further you go. Set them down again before you leave if you need to."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Orrin - rested",
                    Label: "healed"
                }
            ]
        },
